  "description": "In-page contextual banner used to communicate system status, confirmations, warnings, or errors.\n\nVariants & Properties:\n- Use: Neutral | Success | Warning | Danger.\n- Properties: 👁️ Icon, 👁️ Actions, 👁️ Secondary Action, ✏️ Title, ✏️ Description.\n\nDesign rules:\n- When displaying two actions, always pair 1 primary button with 1 secondary button (Outline or Ghost); never place two Primary buttons side by side.\n- Use Toast for brief non-blocking confirmations after saving or copying, and Dialog when explicit blocking confirmation is required.",
